  "ruleText": "Saf-C 2102.01 Nonresident Application. A nonresident applicant for a license to carry pistols and revolvers shall:\n\n(a) Complete the application form DSSP 260 \"Nonresident Pistol/Revolver License\", revised March, 2017; and\n\n(b) Pay the $100 statutory fee pursuant to RSA 159:6, I(b).\n\nSource. #1911, eff 1-11-82; ss by #2608, eff 1-31-84 EXPIRED: 1-31-90 (formerly Saf-P 502.01)\n\nNew. #4891, eff 7-31-90; ss by #6269, eff 6-25-96; ss by #8104, INTERIM, eff 6-25-04, EXPIRES: 12-22-04; ss by #8189, eff 10-15-04; ss by #10380, eff 7-17-13; ss by #13881, eff 2-20-24",
